1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
Previously on Zombieland Saga Revenge!

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:04,000
A few months have passed since our epic fail at EFS,

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,000
and we're still not quite over it,

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
but it seems like a lot of good things are on the horizon for Pran Shushu!

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,000
Our Saga Arena concert filled our spirits,

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,000
and Lily landed a spot on a national TV talent show!

7
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:15,000
It's no surprise she made it to the finals,

8
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:17,000
but she was up against a child acting prodigy

9
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,000
who sang the same song Lily had planned!

10
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Which is, like, the worst thing that could ever happen!

11
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,000
But Lily was such a genius that she improvised a scat arrangement

12
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,000
at the last minute!

13
00:00:24,000 --> 00:00:25,000
It was so amazing that everyone was going

14
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,000
skibbity-ba-ba-ba-dee-ba-doo!

15
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Wee-be-babble-bee-ba-wee-be-dee-babble-bee-

16
00:00:38,000 --> 00:00:41,000
What's with the thousand-yard stare? A new story?

17
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,000
In a few years, you'll have the same look in your eyes.

18
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:46,000
Everyone has been talking about her online.

19
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:48,000
That girl looks exactly like Lily Hoshikawa.

20
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:51,000
They're also picking up on number three and four's likenesses.

21
00:00:51,000 --> 00:00:54,000
After that radio show and Iron Frill calling them rivals,

22
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
they're trending like crazy.

23
00:00:56,000 --> 00:00:58,000
Yeah, but most of the posts are jokes about the group

24
00:00:58,000 --> 00:01:00,000
being a collection of doppelgangers.

25
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:03,000
The more famous you get, the more trolls start to come out.

26
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:05,000
You were the first one who made the connection

27
00:01:05,000 --> 00:01:07,000
between number four and Junko Kono.

28
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,000
You should have started an expose that second.

29
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:13,000
I write the facts, not a gossip column.

30
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:15,000
The only theory I've heard the tracks is that their producer

31
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:17,000
is intentionally collecting look-alikes.

32
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:20,000
Wouldn't be surprised if the rest of them were look-alikes, too.

33
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:23,000
Hey, maybe he raised them from the dead like a bunch of zombies.

34
00:01:23,000 --> 00:01:25,000
Take that trash talk to Mu, the occult mag.

35
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:27,000
Yes, sir, on my way right now.

36
00:01:27,000 --> 00:01:28,000
Just kiddin'.

37
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,000
It's my lunch break.

38
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:33,000
As for the rest of them...

39
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:34,000
Hmmmm.

40
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,000
Hmmmm.

41
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:36,000
.

42
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,000
